Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://steamdb.info/app/813780/
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: aoe2-de-wine-steam
Architecture: all
Depends: gamelaunch, gbe-fork-bin (>= 2026.09.27-2), hicolor-icon-theme, agelanserver-bin, agelanserver-companion-bin (>= 1.5.0.0-2), umu-launcher | wine | libc6:arm64, libc6:amd64 | umu-launcher, libc6:amd64 | fex-emu | box64, aoe2-de-wine-steam-data1 (= ${binary:Version}), aoe2-de-wine-steam-data2 (= ${binary:Version}), aoe2-de-wine-steam-data3 (= ${binary:Version}), aoe2-de-wine-steam-data4 (= ${binary:Version}), aoe2-de-wine-steam-data5 (= ${binary:Version}), aoe2-de-wine-steam-data6 (= ${binary:Version}), aoe2-de-wine-steam-data7 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: Age of Empires II: DE using Wine with data via Steam, ageLANServer for LAN
 Age of Empires II: Definitive Edition (with the Enhanced Graphics Pack), run
 through gamelaunch (umu/Proton or system wine) with the game data downloaded
 from Steam and the Goldberg Steam emulator (gbe-fork-bin). ageLANServer and
 its launcher companion DLLs restore LAN multiplayer lobbies without the
 official servers.

